{"id":"n1bafd478c5","headline":"SPK Puts the Brakes on Hard on Open-Ended Funds","summary":"The Capital Markets Board (SPK) is set to cap how much of a company a single open-ended fund can acquire, at 2 to 8 percent of outstanding shares based on free float. Limits for funds under one manager would be 4 to 16 percent.","why":"The Capital Markets Board regulates Turkish securities markets, and fund ownership limits affect liquidity and concentration in Borsa Istanbul-listed shares.","category":"markets","event_type":"regulation","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Ankara","country":"Turkey","lat":39.93,"lon":32.86,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Bloomberght","url":"https://www.bloomberght.com/spkdan-serbest-fonlara-sert-fren-3786791"},"sources":[{"name":"Bloomberght","url":"https://www.bloomberght.com/spkdan-serbest-fonlara-sert-fren-3786791"}],"published_at":"2026-08-29T10:49:20Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T10:44:44Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"4901c8d65c016ba1","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T10:44:44Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-29T10:49:20Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-29T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"TU","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"SPK’dan serbest fonlara sert fren","source_language":"tur","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/central-bank-building-10423828.jpg","alt":"central bank building (illustration)","credit":"Georg_Wietschorke","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/swallow-bird-flying-wildlife-10423828/"}}